 intro:"Use an ammeter and a voltmeter to find resistance with R = V ÷ I. Investigate how the length of a wire affects its resistance, then compare resistors connected in series and in parallel.",
 stage,bar:`<span>Cell <b>1.5 V</b></span><span>Metre rule resolution <b>1 mm</b></span><span id="rs-status">Switch open</span>`,
